WEBVTT

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.494
Ugh.

00:00:13.061 --> 00:00:14.715
Now, remember,

00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:17.631
any sign of movement,
close your eyes straight away.

00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:20.721
Go on.

00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:26.335
This way.

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:35.039
What's this?

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:38.869
It looks like a...snake.

00:00:38.869 --> 00:00:40.741
It's a snakeskin.

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:42.482
Bloody hell.

00:00:42.482 --> 00:00:46.181
Whatever shed this
must be 60 feet long.

00:00:46.181 --> 00:00:48.357
Or more.

00:00:50.054 --> 00:00:52.796
Heart of a lion, this one.

00:00:56.844 --> 00:01:00.021
The adventure ends here, boys,

00:01:00.021 --> 00:01:01.675
but don't fret.

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:05.853
The world will
know our story.

00:01:05.853 --> 00:01:09.204
How I was too late
to save the girl,

00:01:09.204 --> 00:01:13.034
how you two tragically
lost your minds

00:01:13.034 --> 00:01:16.994
at the sight
of her mangled body.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:19.823
So...

00:01:19.823 --> 00:01:21.912
You first, Mr. Potter.

00:01:21.912 --> 00:01:25.264
Say goodbye to your memories.

00:01:26.874 --> 00:01:28.397
Obliviate!

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:37.058
[RUMBLING]

00:01:55.206 --> 00:01:56.947
Harry!

00:01:59.254 --> 00:02:01.256
Harry!

00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:04.215
Ron!

00:02:04.215 --> 00:02:06.392
Ron, are you okay?I'm fine.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:07.871
[GROANS]

00:02:10.265 --> 00:02:13.137
Hello. Who are you?

00:02:14.225 --> 00:02:16.967
Um...Ron Weasley.

00:02:16.967 --> 00:02:18.578
Really?

00:02:18.578 --> 00:02:21.407
And, uh...wh-who am I?

00:02:23.191 --> 00:02:26.020
Lockhart's memory charm
backfired!

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.587
He hasn't got a clue
who he is!

00:02:27.587 --> 00:02:30.894
It's an odd sort of place,
this, isn't it?

00:02:30.894 --> 00:02:32.069
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:32.069 --> 00:02:33.680
Do you live here?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.595
No.

00:02:35.595 --> 00:02:36.987
Really?

00:02:42.079 --> 00:02:43.951
What do I do now?

00:02:43.951 --> 00:02:45.518
You wait here
and try and shift

00:02:45.518 --> 00:02:47.607
some of this rock
so we can get back through.

00:02:47.607 --> 00:02:49.217
I'll go on and find Ginny.

00:02:49.217 --> 00:02:51.132
Okay.

00:03:06.974 --> 00:03:10.673
[SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE]

